<title>USA: GeoResources completes N. Dakota drilling.</title>
<headline>GeoResources completes N. Dakota drilling.</headline>
<dateline>WILLISTON, N.D. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>GeoResources Inc said Monday it completed drilling operations on the Ballantyne-State/Steinhaus H1 well in Wayne Field, North Dakota.</p>
<p>The well reached a total depth of 8,100. The company said it hopes to start production at the well by July 1.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
